## Interface: 30403
## Title: Spoken Player
## Notes: The voice player every Spoken addon speaks through: one queue, one window, one minimap button.
## Notes-deDE: Der Voice-Player, über den jedes Spoken-Addon spricht, eine Warteschlange, ein Fenster, ein Minimap-Button.
## Notes-esES: El reproductor de voz a través del cual habla cada addon Spoken, una cola, una ventana, un botón del minimapa.
## Notes-esMX: El reproductor de voz a través del cual habla cada addon Spoken, una cola, una ventana, un botón del minimapa.
## Notes-frFR: Le lecteur vocal par lequel chaque addon Spoken parle, une file, une fenêtre, un bouton de minicarte.
## Notes-ptBR: O reprodutor de voz através do qual cada addon Spoken fala, uma fila, uma janela, um botão do minimapa.
## Notes-ruRU: Голосовой проигрыватель, через который говорят все аддоны Spoken, одна очередь, одно окно, одна кнопка у миникарты.
## Notes-koKR: 모든 Spoken 애드온이 말하는 음성 플레이어, 하나의 대기열, 하나의 창, 하나의 미니맵 버튼.
## Notes-zhCN: 所有 Spoken 插件共用的语音播放器，一个队列、一个窗口、一个小地图按钮。
## Notes-zhTW: 所有 Spoken 插件共用的語音播放器，一個佇列、一個視窗、一個小地圖按鈕。
## Version: 2.2.2
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\SpokenPlayer\icon.tga
## SavedVariables: SpokenPlayerDB
## OptionalDeps: VoiceOverRedux, ZoneLore
# The renamed addons' tombstones. Migrate() runs on this addon's ADDON_LOADED and reads
# their saved variables, which exist only once those folders have loaded; without this
# line they sort after "SpokenPlayer" and the settings would be read too early, as empty.
## Group: Spoken
## X-Part-Of: Spoken
## X-Spoken-Player: 1

